<title>BELGIUM: No EU cereals committee meeting until May 15.</title>
<headline>No EU cereals committee meeting until May 15.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>There will be no meeting of the European Union's cereals management committee meeting for the next two weeks due to public holidays in Belgium, an EU member state official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The next meeting will be on May 15. The break is due to the May Day holiday and to the Europe Day holiday the following week,&quot; the official said on Monday. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
